        "text": "Who's better at LLM mischief — humans or AIs? Spoiler: It's us.\n\nHuman red teamers achieve 70%+ attack success rates against LLM defenses that stump automated adversarial attacks. Why? We’re better at adversarial yapping.🧵 https://t.co/A13GVzoYey"
